{"ticker":"INCY","updated":"2026-10-30T22:53:38Z","profile":{"longName":"Incyte Corporation","shortName":"Incyte Corporation","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Biotechnology","country":"United States","website":"https://www.incyte.com","fullTimeEmployees":2844,"marketCap":24402782208,"trailingPE":15.336306,"forwardPE":13.773512,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":4.0598536,"pegRatio":10.82,"targetMeanPrice":130.625,"targetHighPrice":157.0,"targetLowPrice":86.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":24,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.14,"earningsGrowth":null,"grossMargins":0.58582,"operatingMargins":-0.45431998,"profitMargins":0.06711,"totalRevenue":6010754048,"beta":null,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":132.6,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":89.25,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Incyte Corporation, a biopharmaceutical company, engages in the discovery, development, and commercialization of therapeutics in the United States, Europe, Canada, and Japan. The company offers JAKAFI for the treatment of myelofibrosis (MF), polycythemia vera, and steroid-refractory acute graft-versus-host disease; ICLUSIG, a kinase inhibitor to treat chronic myeloid leukemia and Philadelphia-chromosome positive acute lymphoblastic leukemia; MONJUVI/MINJUVI for the treatment of diffuse large B-cell lymphoma and Follicular Lymphoma; NIKTIMVO for the treatment of chronic graft-versus-host disease. It also provides INCA033989 for the treatment of essential thrombocythemia and MF; INCA035784 for the treatment of anti-mutant calreticulin and myeloproliferative neoplasms (MPNs); INCB160058 for the treatment of MPNs; PEMAZYRE, a selective fibroblast growth factor receptor kinase inhibitor for the treatment of unresectable biliary tract cancer, metastatic cholangiocarcinoma, and myeloid/lymphoid neoplasms; ZYNYZ to treat adults with metastatic or recurrent locally advanced Merkel cell carcinoma. The company's clinical stage products include INCB123667 for ovarian cancer; INCB161734 for solid tumors; INCA33890 for cancers; Ruxolitinib cream for atopic dermatitis, hidradenitis suppurativa (HS), and prurigo nodularis; Povorcitinib for HS, nonsegmental vitiligo, prurigo nodularis, and asth","summary_zh":"Incyte Corporation 是一家生物製藥公司，在美國、歐洲、加拿大和日本從事治療藥物的發現、開發和商業化。該公司提供 JAKAFI 用於治療骨髓纖維化（MF）、真性紅血球增多症和類固醇難治性急性移植物抗宿主病； ICLUSIG，一種激酶抑製劑，用於治療慢性粒細胞白血病和費城染色體陽性急性淋巴細胞白血病；MONJUVI/MINJUVI 用於治療瀰漫性大B細胞淋巴瘤和漫泡性腫瘤；也提供INCA033989 治療原發性血小板增多症和MF； INCA035784 治療抗突變鈣網蛋白和骨髓增生性腫瘤（MPN）；INCB160058 治療MPN；PEMAZYRE，一種選擇性纖維母細胞生長因子受體激酶抑制劑，用於治療不可切除的膽道癌、轉移性膽道癌、ZNYZa ZNY和骨髓YZNY ZNY；用於治療患有轉移性或復發性局部晚期默克爾細胞癌的成人。公司臨床階段產品包括用於卵巢癌的INCB123667；INCB161734 用於實體瘤； INCA33890 用於癌症；魯索替尼乳膏用於治療異位性皮膚炎、化膿性汗腺炎 (HS) 和結節性結核病；Povorcitinib 用於治療 HS、非節段性風疹癢疹","sector_zh":"衛生保健","industry_zh":"生物技術","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":84.97,"h":87.99,"l":84.96,"c":85.98,"v":2208500},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":85.92,"h":87.46,"l":85.72,"c":86.96,"v":1986900},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":87.26,"h":87.99,"l":85.42,"c":85.44,"v":2245500},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":85.48,"h":86.69,"l":85.06,"c":86.64,"v":1387700},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":86.48,"h":86.94,"l":85.18,"c":86.56,"v":1222700},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":86.39,"h":87.35,"l":85.32,"c":85.6,"v":1534600},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":85.78,"h":86.94,"l":84.54,"c":86.25,"v":1907300},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":86.0,"h":87.1,"l":85.85,"c":86.17,"v":2012500},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":85.49,"h":85.51,"l":82.82,"c":83.1,"v":1775100},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":82.81,"h":83.66,"l":82.72,"c":83.14,"v":1741100},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":83.15,"h":84.58,"l":83.15,"c":83.9,"v":1691400},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":83.91,"h":85.98,"l":83.51,"c":84.8,"v":1582400},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":84.71,"h":86.07,"l":84.47,"c":86.0,"v":1326600},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":85.86,"h":86.81,"l":85.31,"c":86.53,"v":5483800},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":86.39,"h":86.82,"l":84.38,"c":84.73,"v":1460700},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":84.75,"h":85.83,"l":84.43,"c":84.54,"v":1607300},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":84.19,"h":84.82,"l":83.66,"c":84.16,"v":1297800},{"t":"2025-09-25","o